Package: nexus-monitor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 procps, bsdutils, pkexec, polkitd
Recommends: pci.ids, util-linux, nexus-sysinfo
Description: NEXUS Monitor and Task Manager
 Live processor, memory, graphics, disk and network usage with history,
 sensors and battery, the process list with end, suspend and priority
 actions, and systemd services — all read from the running system.

Package: nexus-installer-gui
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 nexus-installer (= ${source:Version}),
 pkexec, polkitd, tzdata, xkb-data, locales, dbus-user-session
Recommends: os-prober
Description: NEXUS OS graphical installer
 The installation wizard of NEXUS OS: language, keyboard, system check, time
 zone, disk (whole disk, alongside other systems, or manual; optional LUKS2
 encryption), user account and optional security tool profiles. Nothing is
 written to a disk before the exact plan was shown and confirmed. It runs
 unprivileged and starts the installer engine through polkit.

