 nexus-arsenal-reversing (>= ${source:Version}),
 nexus-arsenal-developer (>= ${source:Version})
Suggests: nexus-arsenal
Description: NEXUS Arsenal profile - Complete Arsenal
 The union of all NEXUS Arsenal profiles. Installing it brings in every tool
 from Core Security, Web Application, Network Security, Red Team, Blue Team,
 Forensics, Reverse Engineering and Developer. It is a large installation;
 most users are better served installing the specific profiles they need. The
 tools are referenced from the other profiles, not duplicated here.
 .
 This metapackage depends on the metapackages of the profiles it combines (159
 tools in total).
 .
 These tools are for authorised security testing, research, defence and
 education only: use them on systems you own or have explicit written
 permission to test, and follow the law that applies to you. They come with no
 warranty.

Package: nexus-files
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 kio6, libarchive-tools, breeze-icon-theme, shared-mime-info
Recommends: udisks2, kio-extras, nexus-terminal
Suggests: nexus-archive-manager
Description: NEXUS Files
 The file manager of NEXUS OS: grid and list views, tabs and split view,
 search, previews, trash with restore, permissions, archives, removable
 drives and network locations, with file operations that report progress
 and ask before replacing or deleting.

Package: nexus-security-center
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 nexus-hardening, pkexec, polkitd
Recommends: nexus-updater
Description: NEXUS Security Center
 Shows the real security state of the machine as reported by system checks:
 firewall, AppArmor, disk encryption, Secure Boot, updates, listening
 services and connections, logins, audit events and kernel hardening, with
 the recommendations that follow from them, and manages the host firewall.
 It reports states with their evidence; it does not compute scores.

Package: nexus-screenshot
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 kwin-wayland, qt6-image-formats-plugins
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, nexus-files
Description: NEXUS Screenshot
 Captures the whole screen, one monitor, a window or a selected region, with
 optional delay, then offers saving, copying to the clipboard and simple
 annotations (crop, arrow, rectangle, text, pixelate). Also usable from the
 command line.

Package: nexus-disk-manager
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 udisks2, polkitd, e2fsprogs, dosfstools
Recommends: cryptsetup-bin, btrfs-progs, exfatprogs, ntfs-3g, smartmontools
Suggests: xfsprogs, f2fs-tools
Description: NEXUS Disk Manager
 Drives and partitions through UDisks2: partition map, mounting, LUKS
 unlock, formatting, partition tables, resizing, checking and disk images.
 Destructive actions name the device, list what will be lost, require the
 device name to be typed and are refused for the disk the system runs from.

Package: nexus-recovery
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 python3, util-linux, e2fsprogs, dosfstools, cryptsetup-bin, lvm2, pkexec, polkitd
Recommends: nexus-terminal, efibootmgr
Description: NEXUS Recovery
 Repairs a NEXUS OS installation that no longer starts or updates, from the
 installation medium or the system itself: finds installed systems, unlocks
 encrypted ones, re-installs the boot loader and initramfs, completes
 interrupted package operations, checks file systems, resets a password and
 collects logs. Every step explains what it changes before it runs.

Package: nexus-editor
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 fonts-jetbrains-mono
Description: NEXUS Text Editor
 A programmer's text editor: tabs, syntax highlighting, find and replace
 with regular expressions, encoding and line-ending handling that never
 corrupts a file, atomic saves and a warning when a file changed on disk.

Package: nexus-archive-manager
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, nexus-ui (= ${binary:Version}),
 libarchive-tools, 7zip, xdg-utils
Description: NEXUS Archive Manager
 Browse, extract, create and test archives (tar and its compressed forms,
 zip, 7z, cpio; ISO and RAR read-only). Extraction never writes outside the
 chosen folder, drops device nodes and setuid bits, and warns before
 unpacking archives that expand implausibly.
